 "captions": [
  {
   "start": 1.2,
   "end": 10.775063,
   "text": "This is TEMT, the Transportation Emission Measurement Tool from the TCI\u2013IIMB Supply Chain Sustainability Lab at IIM Bangalore."
  },
  {
   "start": 11.155063,
   "end": 13.508188,
   "text": "Here is the whole product, end to end."
  },
  {
   "start": 15.059718027389525,
   "end": 24.516697027389526,
   "text": "The website's hero calculator is live: two cities and a weight, and it compares road, rail, air and coastal shipping with the same engine as the product."
  },
  {
   "start": 24.89669702738953,
   "end": 28.885322027389527,
   "text": "Below are the credentials, and every module you're about to see."
  },
  {
   "start": 29.585718050277706,
   "end": 35.268864050277706,
   "text": "Open TEMT and start with your company, the guided tour, or a sample workspace."
  },
  {
   "start": 35.64886405027771,
   "end": 40.57576005027771,
   "text": "We'll load the FMCG sample, labelled as sample data everywhere."
  },
  {
   "start": 41.27671803501892,
   "end": 48.65428103501892,
   "text": "The overview shows the year's well-to-wheel emissions, intensity per tonne-kilometre, and progress against your target."
  },
  {
   "start": 49.034281035018914,
   "end": 60.68690603501892,
   "text": "Each month splits into tank-to-wheel and well-to-tank, as ISO 14083 requires, followed by modes, business units, lanes and reduction opportunities."
  },
  {
   "start": 61.38771809605407,
   "end": 69.98369709605407,
   "text": "The quick calculator compares every practical mode, door to door. Pune to Kolkata by rail is about eighty-five percent lower than by truck."
  },
  {
   "start": 71.28771819142152,
   "end": 77.14844719142152,
   "text": "The full calculator covers road, courier, rail, air, sea and inland waterways."
  },
  {
   "start": 77.52844719142152,
   "end": 85.72951019142153,
   "text": "Enter a city or a PIN code, and TEMT estimates the shortest feasible distance. Pick the truck class, and the result updates live."
  },
  {
   "start": 86.10951019142152,
   "end": 94.52765619142153,
   "text": "The calculation basis shows what an auditor needs: activity, distance type, intensity, factor source and data quality."
  },
  {
   "start": 94.90765619142152,
   "end": 98.94163519142151,
   "text": "With fuel receipts, switch to fuel-based for primary data."
  },
  {
   "start": 101.12771810559083,
   "end": 107.91153110559083,
   "text": "Rail, air and sea work the same way. Rail uses the Indian average for mixed diesel and electric traction."
  },
  {
   "start": 108.29153110559083,
   "end": 117.09140610559083,
   "text": "Air uses great-circle distances between airports, and sea legs are routed port to port through a sea-lane network, by trade lane or vessel type."
  },
  {
   "start": 123.13771809605409,
   "end": 132.2455310960541,
   "text": "Compare modes ranks road, rail, air and coastal options for the same cargo, flags impractical ones, and saves your choice to the ledger."
  },
  {
   "start": 133.5377181914215,
   "end": 146.7215311914215,
   "text": "Real freight is often multimodal. The chain builder links legs and hubs in one shipment: here, a factory to the gateway port by trailer, then a container ship, with terminal handling counted as a hub operation."
  },
  {
   "start": 148.33871807125854,
   "end": 157.96792607125855,
   "text": "Bulk import reads the TEMT template, six production TEMT formats and GST e-way bills, and checks every row before anything is saved."
  },
  {
   "start": 158.66971816090393,
   "end": 166.01798916090394,
   "text": "Every shipment lands in the ledger. Search, filter, and open any one to see its legs and calculation basis."
  },
  {
   "start": 167.20571817425537,
   "end": 173.00359317425537,
   "text": "Accounts are optional. Sign in, and your workspace syncs securely across devices."
  },
  {
   "start": 173.38359317425537,
   "end": 179.02519717425537,
   "text": "The server recalculates it independently, and your sessions and report history live here."
  },
  {
   "start": 181.22771801022338,
   "end": 186.88173901022338,
   "text": "Reports are read in the tool first, down to the SEBI BRSR Principle 6 mapping."
  },
  {
   "start": 187.26173901022338,
   "end": 194.7790720102234,
   "text": "Then export them in six formats: PDF, Excel, Word, CSV, JSON and Power BI."
  },
  {
   "start": 198.16371811894226,
   "end": 204.22513511894226,
   "text": "A board-ready PDF, with charts, the BRSR table, methodology and factors."
  },
  {
   "start": 204.9277180579071,
   "end": 208.9524890579071,
   "text": "An Excel workbook with a sheet for every view, down to each leg."
  },
  {
   "start": 210.7417181876068,
   "end": 212.2358431876068,
   "text": "An editable Word report."
  },
  {
   "start": 213.45671810177612,
   "end": 216.74638510177613,
   "text": "A Power BI pack with a star schema and DAX measures."
  },
  {
   "start": 217.4477180388336,
   "end": 220.5265100388336,
   "text": "Plus CSV and JSON for any other system."
  },
  {
   "start": 221.22871817616272,
   "end": 230.63471817616272,
   "text": "The reduction planner tests rail shift, air to road, consolidation, electric trucks and load factors, and measures each lever against your target."
  },
  {
   "start": 231.33471812275695,
   "end": 242.45432212275696,
   "text": "The factor library lists every value and its source. Switch between GLEC v3.2 India defaults and the production TEMT set, and every shipment recalculates."
  },
  {
   "start": 242.83432212275696,
   "end": 249.67242612275695,
   "text": "Settings hold your NIFTY 500 company, targets, backups, and an optional local AI model."
  },
  {
   "start": 250.37371815708923,
   "end": 252.38484315708922,
   "text": "The Copilot runs in your browser."
  },
  {
   "start": 252.76484315708922,
   "end": 256.40109315708924,
   "text": "Twenty tonnes, Mumbai to Delhi, by thirty-two foot truck."
  },
  {
   "start": 256.78109315708923,
   "end": 258.02336415708925,
   "text": "Compare that with rail."
  },
  {
   "start": 258.40336415708924,
   "end": 267.2021141570892,
   "text": "Summarise FY 2025\u201326. It calculates, compares, analyses and exports, on request."
  },
  {
   "start": 267.903718128479,
   "end": 271.217343128479,
   "text": "And a fourteen-step guided tour explains every screen."
  },
  {
   "start": 273.657614984787,
   "end": 282.23640698478704,
   "text": "TEMT: India-specific factors, an ISO 14083-aligned method, and reports that stand up to scrutiny."
  },
  {
   "start": 282.61640698478703,
   "end": 284.49978198478703,
   "text": "Measure your next shipment today."
  }
 ],
